{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Leisure Time"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What Makes a Stamp Valuable?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "factor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "reason; explanation"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The price of the stamp is based on two factors."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about the price of stamps."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to depend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change according to something else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  The value of a stamp depends on supply and demand."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supply"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "how much of a product or service is available"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A stamp is usually valuable if it exists in  limited supply."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "demand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "how many people want to obtain a product or service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  A stamp is also available if there is a large demand for it. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "category"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group or part of something that are divided according to what they have in common"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are three types of stamp categories: mint, unused, and used."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glue"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "adhesive product used to stick one thing to another"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Other factors also affect the value of a stamp, such as the type of glue."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "collector"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who likes to collect an item"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some stamps are sometimes worth up to a million dollars to a collector."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob10aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Frequency"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens.<br><br>Sometimes the adverb specifies the exact frequency of the action, like <span class=\"italic\"> yearly</span> or <span class=\"italic\"> daily</span>. These are called definite adverbs of frequency."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Indefinite adverbs of frequency are usually placed before the verb.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">I often walk home from work.</span><br/><br/> With verb tenses that have two parts, or when an auxiliary is used, the adverb is placed between the auxiliary and the main verb.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">I can rarely eat chocolate.</span> <br/><br/>  Definite adverbs of frequency are usually placed after the main verb or direct object if there is one.<br/> e.g. <span class=\"italic\">We go to the stamp convention yearly.</span>; <span class=\"italic\">We can go yearly.</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How Often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"80%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"daily\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a day\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"weekly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a week\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"biweekly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once every two weeks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"monthly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a month\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"yearly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"once a year\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Why is it that some stamps are sometimes worth a few cents while others are worth up to a million dollars? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Used stamps often have a cancellation mark because they have been mailed on a letter.  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Manner"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adverbs of manner to describe how something is done.<br/><br/>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">You look carefully at them!</span><br>How do you look? Carefully."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Many adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly</span> to an adjective. When the adjective ends in <span class=\"strong\">y</span>, you take out the letter and add <span class=\"italic\">\u2013ily</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <br/> slow \u2013 slowly<br/> happy \u2013 happily "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The adjectives <span class=\"italic\">fast</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hard</span>, <span class=\"italic\">well </span>and <span class=\"italic\">straight</span> are exceptions.  They do not change when they become adverbs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some adverbs, like <span class=\"italic\">basically</span> or <span class=\"italic\">generally</span>, are often placed at the beginning of the sentence."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"direct<br> obvious<br>\\t enthusiastic<br> definite<br>\\t competitive<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"directly<br> obviously<br> enthusiastically <br>definitely<br> competitively\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The price of the stamp depends directly on two factors: demand and condition."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Obviously, mint stamps are the most valuable."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Not all the words that end in <span class=\"strong\">ly</span> are adverb. <br/><br/> For example: <br>Supply, is a verb and also a noun.<br> Holy, is an adjective.<br> Friendly  and lovely are adjectives, too.<br> Dragonfly, is a noun. Apply, is a verb."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le17ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of things other than (not) stamps that people collect."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do research on 2 different collections. Read articles or watch videos online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Complete the table with the information you found."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your results to a partner."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Collection:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">What affects the price?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">How do you call the collectors?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">What kinds of things do they collect?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Where do they obtain the items?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research 2 different collections."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I complete t