 have never been sent. Used stamps are the most common and plentiful. They are often stamps that have a cancellation mark because they have been mailed on a letter."}, {"time": "40000", "image": "engenn6le17ob10re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "There are other factors that also affect the value of a stamp, such as the type of glue and the way the design is centered. So don't throw out those old stamps before you look carefully at them!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le17ob10re6aud04"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}]}]}